flowchart TD
    User([Developer question]) --> Retrieve

    subgraph Pipeline[DocuBot Pro Pipeline]
        Retrieve[RETRIEVE<br/>keyword scoring over<br/>paragraph chunks]
        Assess[ASSESS<br/>confidence layer:<br/>top_score, hit_count, gap]
        Decide{DECIDE<br/>should_answer?}
        Generate[GENERATE<br/>Gemini answers using<br/>only retrieved snippets]
        Caveat[Attach<br/>verify caveat]
        Refuse[REFUSE<br/>defer to human]
    end

    Retrieve -->|scored chunks| Assess
    Assess -->|ConfidenceReport| Decide

    Decide -->|LOW: guardrail| Refuse
    Decide -->|HIGH| Generate
    Decide -->|MEDIUM| Caveat
    Caveat --> Generate

    Generate --> Answer([Answer + sources])
    Refuse --> Answer

    Assess -.decision steps.-> Trace[(Trace log<br/>logs/trace.log)]
    Decide -.decision steps.-> Trace
    Trace -.reviewed by.-> Human([Human review])
    Refuse -.escalates to.-> Human

    Eval[Evaluation harness<br/>evaluation.py] -.offline checks.-> Assess
